+// Direct3D 9 shader bytecode (vs/ps 2.0 and 3.0, as carried by SVGA_3D_CMD_SHADER_DEFINE) → GLSL ES 3.00.
+//
+// The token format is the public D3D9 one (d3d9types.h): a version token, then instructions (opcode in the low 16
+// bits, instruction length in bits 24-27), parameter tokens with register type/number, write masks, swizzles and
+// modifiers, comments, and an end token.
