+// Conventions of the generated code:
+// - vertex inputs v# use layout(location = #); the renderer binds vertex declarations by (usage, usage index);
+// - vertex outputs and pixel inputs meet as varyings named after (usage, usage index); POSITION is gl_Position;
+// - constants live in uniform arrays (u_c, u_i, u_b); `def`/`defi`/`defb` become local constants;
+// - D3D clip space is converted at the end of the vertex shader: y is negated (render targets keep row 0 at GL
+//   row 0) and z goes from [0, w] to [-w, w].
